sequenceDiagram
    participant user as Usuário
    participant browser as Navegador
    participant server as Servidor

    user->>browser: Writes a note
    user->>browser: Clicks Submit

    Note right of browser: JavaScript intercepts the form dispatch
    Note right of browser: preventDefault() avoids page reload

    Note right of browser: Create an object with content and date
    Note right of browser: Adds the note to a local list
    Note right of browser: Updates the shown notes list

    browser->>server: POST /exampleapp/new_note_spa
    Note right of browser: Sends the note as JSON

    activate server
    Note right of server: Add the note to a storage list in the server
    server-->>browser: Response from the request
    deactivate server

    Note right of browser: The page remains loaded, without redirecting